# producerShape / guardedPrevReads of body p3. Result: the guarded previous-element reads
# (word j of the column is 1 for body node j), the status (0 undefined, 1 a producer with
# previous-element reads (a recurrence), 2 a pure producer), 1 when guardedPrevReads is defined,
# 1 when the ret node is `set p0 p1 v`, and the ret node.

